{"id":"671a62cde4866234","group":"58","path":"58/batch19/58-df-zfc-graph-acyclic-digraph.md","title":"ZFC Graph Acyclic Digraph","display":"df-zfc-graph-acyclic-digraph — ZFC Graph Acyclic Digraph","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-graph-acyclic-digraph","aliases":["58-df-zfc-graph-acyclic-digraph"],"display":"df-zfc-graph-acyclic-digraph — ZFC Graph Acyclic Digraph","depends_on":["[[58-df-zfc-comb6-acyclic-directed-graph]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-graph-acyclic-digraph"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-graph-acyclic-digraph</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-graph-acyclic-digraph — ZFC Graph Acyclic Digraph"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ea01bce0627a3efb\" href=\"?note=ea01bce0627a3efb\" title=\"58-df-zfc-comb6-acyclic-directed-graph\">58-df-zfc-comb6-acyclic-directed-graph</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D,X,E\\in V\">\\(D,X,E\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcComb6AcyclicDirectedGraph}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcComb6AcyclicDirectedGraph}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ea01bce0627a3efb\" href=\"?note=ea01bce0627a3efb\" title=\"58-df-zfc-comb6-acyclic-directed-graph\">58-df-zfc-comb6-acyclic-directed-graph</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcGraphAcyclicDigraph}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcGraphAcyclicDigraph}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}graph\\text{-}acyclic\\text{-}digraph}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcGraphAcyclicDigraph}_S(D)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists X,E\\in V\\;\\bigl(\nD=\\langle X,E\\rangle\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcComb6AcyclicDirectedGraph}_S(X,E)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}graph\\text{-}acyclic\\text{-}digraph}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcGraphAcyclicDigraph}_S(D)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists X,E\\in V\\;\\bigl(\nD=\\langle X,E\\rangle\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcComb6AcyclicDirectedGraph}_S(X,E)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The graph code exposes its vertex and arc sets and delegates acyclicity to the existing predicate that forbids every positive-length closed directed walk.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-zfc-comb6-acyclic-directed-graph","status":"resolved","id":"ea01bce0627a3efb","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-comb6-acyclic-directed-graph]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-comb6-acyclic-directed-graph","status":"resolved","id":"ea01bce0627a3efb","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcComb6AcyclicDirectedGraph}_S\\subseteq V^2$ (see [[58-df-zfc-comb6-acyclic-directed-graph]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"D,X,E\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcComb6AcyclicDirectedGraph}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcGraphAcyclicDigraph}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}graph\\text{-}acyclic\\text{-}digraph}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcGraphAcyclicDigraph}_S(D)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists X,E\\in V\\;\\bigl(\nD=\\langle X,E\\rangle\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcComb6AcyclicDirectedGraph}_S(X,E)\\bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":951,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2230","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-zfc-graph-acyclic-digraph.md|58-df-zfc-graph-acyclic-digraph]]（batch19）"}],"outgoing":["ea01bce0627a3efb"]}